# P12 W4 (docs/design/sdk.md 13.3): Chute. SELECT on its row starts
# a game on the pale LCD: the plane top left, every jumper position
# printed faintly, the rower in the middle lane, the lake's waves, the
# score, three faint miss marks and Best. Jumpers step down on the beat;
# the wheel rows the boat a lane per step (left, then right twice).
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui-mod scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p12-chute-start.script
# needs: modules
# reset: mainmenu

wait 4000
sdk_clear            # a fresh game
wheel +2             # Extras
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +4             # Games
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +2             # Chute, below Bricks and Chess
wait 600
key SELECT           # Chute
wait 800
shot start
wait 1300
shot falling
wheel -1 100         # the boat a lane left
wait 300
shot left
wheel +2 150         # two lanes right
wait 300
shot right
wait 3000
shot later
quit
